+msgstr ""
+"运行角色脚本前，请导出 `MODEL_PATH`、`LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME`。PP 角色还需要 `P0_IP`；P1 使用相同的 "
+"P0 主节点地址，并以无 API 服务的模式运行。所有节点使用相同的权重路径。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.1.1 Single-Node Deployment"
+msgstr "#### 5.1.1 单节点部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"The GLM-5.2 and GLM-5.3 W4A4C8/MXFP4 checkpoints can run on one\n"
+"    950DT products (96GB × 8) node with DP1/TP8. The command below uses\n"
+"    GLM-5.3; for GLM-5.2, replace the checkpoint path with\n"
+"    `/root/.cache/modelscope/hub/models/vllm-ascend/GLM-5.2-w4a4c8-mxfp4`.\n"
+"    Startup and short requests were validated; see\n"
+"    [W4A4C8 Validation](#73-w4a4c8-950dt-products-validation-records) for details."
+msgstr ""
+"GLM-5.2 和 GLM-5.3 的 W4A4C8/MXFP4 权重可在 1 个 950DT products（96GB × 8）节点上以 "
+"DP1/TP8 运行。下方命令使用 GLM-5.3；部署 GLM-5.2 时，请将权重路径替换为 "
+"`/root/.cache/modelscope/hub/models/vllm-"
+"ascend/GLM-5.2-w4a4c8-mxfp4`。已验证启动及短请求，详情参阅 [W4A4C8 验证记录](#73-w4a4c8-950dt-"
+"products-validation-records)。"
+
+msgid "###### Start the Engine"
+msgstr "###### 启动引擎"
+
+msgid "**Key Parameter Descriptions — 950DT products**"
+msgstr "**关键参数说明 — 950DT products**"
+
+msgid ""
+"- DP1/TP8 runs one engine across eight devices; `--enable-expert-parallel`\n"
+"      distributes MoE experts within the configured parallel groups.\n"
+"    - `--max-model-len 135000` caps input plus output tokens. The scheduler\n"
+"      limits are 20 sequences and 16384 batched tokens per iteration; these\n"
+"      settings do not establish full-length capacity or accuracy validation.\n"
+"    - `--quantization ascend` loads the W4A4C8/MXFP4 checkpoint. The example\n"
+"      uses FP8 attention and indexer KV caches; retain the matching checkpoint.\n"
+"    - `--enforce-eager` disables graph execution. FlashComm1, CPU binding,\n"
+"      shared-expert overlap and DSA CP are selected by `--additional-config`.\n"
+"    - `HCCL_BUFFSIZE=400` reserves the communication buffer size described in\n"
+"      [Common Parameter Descriptions](#glm-common-parameters)."
+msgstr ""
+"- DP1/TP8 在 8 个设备上运行一个引擎；`--enable-expert-parallel` 在配置的并行组中分布 MoE 专家。\n"
+"    - `--max-model-len 135000` 限制输入与输出 Token 总数；调度器每次迭代最多处理 20 个序列和 16384 个 Token。这些设置不代表已验证完整上下文容量或精度。\n"
+"    - `--quantization ascend` 加载 W4A4C8/MXFP4 权重。本例使用 FP8 注意力及索引器 KV 缓存，请保留匹配的权重。\n"
+"    - `--enforce-eager` 禁用图执行。`--additional-config` 配置 FlashComm1、CPU 绑定、共享专家重叠执行及 DSA CP。\n"
+"    - `HCCL_BUFFSIZE=400` 设置通信缓冲区大小，详见[公共参数说明](#glm-common-parameters)。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For a reduced context of 32768 tokens, the W8A8C8 checkpoint can run on 1 A3"
+" series (128GB × 8) with DP1/TP16. Select the GLM-5.2 or GLM-5.3 checkpoint "
+"below. This is not the full-context deployment: use the multi-node "
+"deployment for longer contexts."
+msgstr ""
+"将上下文缩短到 32768 Token 后，W8A8C8 权重可在 1 个 A3 系列（128GB × 8）节点上以 DP1/TP16 "
+"运行。请在下方选择 GLM-5.2 或 GLM-5.3 权重。这不是完整上下文部署，更长上下文应使用多节点配置。"
+
+msgid "**Key Parameter Descriptions — A3 series**"
+msgstr "**关键参数说明 — A3 系列**"
+
+msgid ""
+"- DP1/TP16 uses all 16 logical devices for one engine. This is the\n"
+"      reduced-context W8A8C8 layout, with a maximum of 32768 total tokens.\n"
+"    - `--max-num-seqs 12` and `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` cap concurrent\n"
+"      sequences and scheduled tokens per iteration; adjust them to KV capacity.\n"
+"    - `--quantization ascend` loads ModelSlim W8A8C8 weights. Both attention\n"
+"      and indexer KV caches use `int8` in this hardware tab.\n"
+"    - `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` captures only Decode execution; `deepseek_mtp` uses\n"
+"      three speculative tokens with an eager draft model.\n"
+"    - `HCCL_BUFFSIZE=200` follows the common HCCL buffer definition above."
+msgstr ""
+"- DP1/TP16 使用全部 16 个逻辑设备运行一个引擎。这是缩短上下文的 W8A8C8 配置，序列总长度上限为 32768 Token。\n"
+"    - `--max-num-seqs 12` 和 `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` 分别限制每次迭代的并发序列数及调度 Token 数，请根据 KV 缓存容量调整。\n"
+"    - `--quantization ascend` 加载 ModelSlim W8A8C8 权重。本硬件标签页的注意力及索引器 KV 缓存均使用 `int8`。\n"
+"    - `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 仅捕获 Decode 执行图；`deepseek_mtp` 使用 3 个推测 Token，草稿模型以 eager 模式执行。\n"
+"    - `HCCL_BUFFSIZE=200` 的含义见上方公共 HCCL 缓冲区定义。"
+
+msgid ""
+"If you want to deploy a multi-node environment, first verify the data-plane "
+"network by following [Verify Multi-node Communication "
+"Environment](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-"
+"interconnect)."
+msgstr ""
+"部署多节点环境前，请按照[验证多节点通信环境](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-"
+"multi-node-interconnect)确认数据面网络互通。"
+
+msgid "###### Topology and Prerequisites"
+msgstr "###### 拓扑与前置条件"
+
+msgid ""
+"See [950DT preparation](#glm-950-preparation) for checkpoint, environment "
+"and PP-node settings."
+msgstr "权重、环境和 PP 节点设置请参阅 [950DT 准备工作](#glm-950-preparation)。"
+
+msgid "###### Prepare the Scripts"
+msgstr "###### 准备脚本"
+
+msgid "###### Start the Engines"
+msgstr "###### 启动引擎"
+
+msgid "Run on each node after setting its environment variables:"
+msgstr "在每个节点配置好环境变量后运行："
+
+msgid ""
+"The following settings apply only to this 950DT products tab; use the\n"
+"    topology and scripts in the other tabs for A3 or A2 series."
+msgstr "以下设置仅适用于本 950DT products 标签页；A3 或 A2 系列应使用对应标签页中的拓扑和脚本。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` and `--tensor-parallel-size 8` split one\n"
+"      engine across two nodes. `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"42,36\"` assigns\n"
+"      the layers to the two PP stages.\n"
+"    - `--master-addr` selects node 0. Node 0 exposes API port `8000`;\n"
+"      node 1 uses `--headless` and joins the same PP engine.\n"
+"    - `--max-model-len 135000`, `--max-num-seqs 500`, and\n"
+"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 16384` set the context and scheduler limits.\n"
+"      Adjust the scheduler limits for the target workload.\n"
+"    - `--kv-cache-dtype fp8` and `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8`\n"
+"      enable FP8 attention and indexer KV caches.\n"
+"    - `--speculative-config` enables `deepseek_mtp` with five speculative\n"
+"      tokens and an eager draft. `--enforce-eager` also keeps the main\n"
+"      engine in eager mode.\n"
+"    - `--additional-config` enables DSA CP, FlashComm1, CPU binding and\n"
+"      `enable_fused_mc2: 1`. Both PP nodes use the same configuration."
+msgstr ""
+"- `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size 8` 将一个引擎分布在两个节点上。`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"42,36\"` 将模型层分配到两个 PP 阶段。\n"
+"    - `--master-addr` 指向节点 0。节点 0 提供 API 端口 `8000`；节点 1 使用 `--headless` 加入同一个 PP 引擎。\n"
+"    - `--max-model-len 135000`、`--max-num-seqs 500` 和 `--max-num-batched-tokens 16384` 设置上下文与调度限制，应按目标负载调整。\n"
+"    - `--kv-cache-dtype fp8` 和 `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8` 启用 FP8 注意力及索引器 KV 缓存。\n"
+"    - `--speculative-config` 启用 `deepseek_mtp`，使用 5 个推测 Token 和 eager 草稿模型。`--enforce-eager` 同时让主引擎以 eager 模式运行。\n"
+"    - `--additional-config` 启用 DSA CP、FlashComm1、CPU 绑定及 `enable_fused_mc2: 1`。两个 PP 节点使用相同配置。"
+
+msgid ""
+"##### A3 series {: #glm52-53-5-1-2-a3 }\n"
+"    -  `GLM-5.3-w8a8c8`: can be deployed on 2 A3 series (64GB × 16)."
+msgstr ""
+"##### A3 系列 {: #glm52-53-5-1-2-a3 }\n"
+"    - `GLM-5.3-w8a8c8`：可部署在 2 个 A3 系列（64GB × 16）节点上。"
+
+msgid "- `GLM-5.3-w8a8c8`: can be deployed on 4 A2 series (64GB × 8)."
+msgstr "- `GLM-5.3-w8a8c8`：可部署在 4 个 A2 系列（64GB × 8）节点上。"
+
+msgid "Run the following scripts on four nodes respectively."
+msgstr "在 4 个节点上分别运行以下脚本。"
+
+msgid "**Key Parameter Descriptions**"
+msgstr "**关键参数说明**"
+
+msgid ""
+"The following descriptions cover the hardware tabs in this section; each\n"
+"platform-specific group is labeled. Shared parameter meanings are listed in\n"
+"[Common Parameter Descriptions](#glm-common-parameters)."
+msgstr ""
+"以下说明涵盖本节各硬件标签页，平台专属配置已分别标注。共有参数的含义请参阅[公共参数说明](#glm-common-parameters)。"
+
+msgid "**A3 network and data parallel configuration:**"
+msgstr "**A3 网络与数据并行配置：**"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `HCCL_IF_IP`, `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`: Network interface configuration for multi-node communication. Set `nic_name` to the network interface name (obtained via `ifconfig`) and `local_ip` to the current node's IP address. These must be correctly configured on each node for successful multi-node communication.\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-size 8`: Total number of data parallel ranks across all nodes (4 ranks per node in this scenario).\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-size-local 4`: Number of data parallel ranks on the current node.\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-start-rank`: Starting rank offset for data parallel ranks on this node. Node 0 uses `0`, node 1 uses `4`.\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-address`: IP address of the data parallel master node (node 0). Must match the `local_ip` of the master node.\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port 12980`: RPC port for data parallel master communication. Must be the same across all nodes.\n"
+"- `--headless`: Used on node 1. Node 0 hosts the API server."
+msgstr ""
+"- `HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`：配置多节点通信网卡。将 `nic_name` 设为通过 `ifconfig` 获取的网卡名，`local_ip` 设为当前节点 IP。每个节点都必须正确配置，才能完成多节点通信。\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-size 8`：所有节点合计 8 个数据并行 rank，本场景每节点 4 个。\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-size-local 4`：当前节点的数据并行 rank 数。\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-start-rank`：当前节点的数据并行起始 rank。节点 0 使用 `0`，节点 1 使用 `4`。\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-address`：数据并行主节点（节点 0）的 IP，必须与其 `local_ip` 一致。\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port 12980`：数据并行主节点通信的 RPC 端口，所有节点必须一致。\n"
+"- `--headless`：用于节点 1；节点 0 负责提供 API 服务。"
+
+msgid "**A2 four-node network and data parallel configuration:**"
+msgstr "**A2 四节点网络与数据并行配置：**"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `HCCL_IF_IP`, `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, and\n"
+"  `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`: Set each node's local IP and matching network\n"
+"  interface for multi-node communication.\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-size 4`: Four global DP ranks, one per A2 node.\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-size-local 1`: One local DP rank per node, using TP8.\n"
+"- Node 0 hosts the API and omits `--data-parallel-start-rank`, so rank 0\n"
+"  is inferred automatically. Nodes 1-3 use `--headless` and explicitly\n"
+"  set `--data-parallel-start-rank` to 1, 2, and 3, respectively.\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-address`: Node 0's IP, shared by all four nodes.\n"
+"  `--data-parallel-rpc-port 12980` must also match on every node."
+msgstr ""
+"- `HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME` 和 `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`：设置各节点的本地 IP 和对应网卡，用于多节点通信。\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-size 4`：全局 4 个 DP rank，每个 A2 节点 1 个。\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-size-local 1`：每节点运行 1 个本地 DP rank，使用 TP8。\n"
+"- 节点 0 提供 API，不设置 `--data-parallel-start-rank`，自动推断为 rank 0。节点 1–3 使用 `--headless`，并将 `--data-parallel-start-rank` 分别显式设置为 1、2、3。\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-address`：4 个节点共用节点 0 的 IP；`--data-parallel-rpc-port 12980` 也必须在所有节点保持一致。"
+
+msgid ""
+"In this internal-DP layout, explicitly setting `--data-parallel-start-rank 0` on the\n"
+"API node triggers external/hybrid DP load-balancing inference. The remote\n"
+"headless engines are then rejected with\n"
+"`Remote engine must not use --headless in external or hybrid dp lb mode`.\n"
+"Keep the API node's rank implicit so all four EngineCores join the same\n"
+"DP group."
+msgstr ""
+"在此内部 DP 负载均衡配置中，若在 API 节点显式设置 `--data-parallel-start-rank 0`，会触发外部或混合 DP "
+"负载均衡模式，远端无 API 引擎会被拒绝，并报错 `Remote engine must not use --headless in external"
+" or hybrid dp lb mode`。请让 API 节点自动推断 rank，使全部 4 个 EngineCore 加入同一 DP 组。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Use `scheduler_config.enable_balance_scheduling` and\n"
+"`ascend_compilation_config.fuse_muls_add` inside `--additional-config`.\n"
+"The scheduler setting belongs under `scheduler_config` (the top-level form\n"
+"is deprecated); `fuse_muls_add` belongs under `ascend_compilation_config`."
+msgstr ""
+"请在 `--additional-config` 中配置 `scheduler_config.enable_balance_scheduling` 和 "
+"`ascend_compilation_config.fuse_muls_add`。调度设置应置于 `scheduler_config` "
+"下，顶层写法已弃用；`fuse_muls_add` 应置于 `ascend_compilation_config` 下。"
+
+msgid "**A2-specific environment variables:**"
+msgstr "**A2 专属环境变量：**"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `CPU_AFFINITY_CONF=1`: Enables CPU core affinity binding for worker processes.\n"
+"- `ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`: ACL operator initialization mode to speed up operator compilation.\n"
+"- `VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT=360000` / `VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30000` / `HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT=200` / `HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=120` / `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=1200`: Timeout settings for multi-node startup and model execution on the slower A2 platform. Increase them if the engine fails to become ready in time.\n"
+"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`: Selects the V1 model runner for the A2 examples."
+msgstr ""
+"- `CPU_AFFINITY_CONF=1`：启用工作进程的 CPU 核亲和性绑定。\n"
+"- `ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`：设置 ACL 算子初始化模式，以加速算子编译。\n"
+"- `VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT=360000` / `VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30000` / `HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT=200` / `HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=120` / `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=1200`：多节点启动及模型执行的超时配置。A2 平台启动较慢，若引擎未能及时就绪，可增大这些值。\n"
+"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`：为 A2 示例选择 V1 模型运行器。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc`: Enables 4-bit TurboQuant "
+"quantization for the SFA packed main KV cache, as an alternative to `--kv-"
+"cache-dtype int8`. It requires an A2/A3 device, does not support context "
+"parallelism (DCP/PCP), cannot be combined with the C8 cache, and in Prefill-"
+"Decode disaggregation the Mooncake option `\"use_ascend_direct\"` must be "
+"`false`."
+msgstr ""
+"- `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc`：为 SFA 打包主 KV 缓存启用 4 位 TurboQuant "
+"量化，替代 `--kv-cache-dtype int8`。该功能需要 A2/A3 设备，不支持上下文并行（DCP/PCP），不能与 C8 "
+"缓存同时使用；在 Prefill-Decode 分离场景中，Mooncake 的 `\"use_ascend_direct\"` 必须设置为 "
+"`false`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"**A3-specific fused MC2 notice:**\n"
+"This scenario enables `additional_config.enable_fused_mc2=1` (fused `dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe` operators). Fused MC2 conflicts with `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` — the two optimizations must not be enabled at the same time (the runtime forcibly disables `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` when fused MC2 is on).\n"
+"The A2 four-node commands in this section do not enable fused MC2."
+msgstr ""
+"**A3 专属融合 MC2 注意事项：**\n"
+"本场景启用 `additional_config.enable_fused_mc2=1`（融合 `dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe` 算子）。融合 MC2 与 `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` 冲突，不能同时启用；运行时会在启用融合 MC2 后强制禁用 `multistream_overlap_shared_expert`。本节 A2 四节点命令不启用融合 MC2。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Shared parameter meanings are listed in [Common Parameter Descriptions](#glm-common-parameters).\n"
+"Topology, role-specific limits and connector settings are explained in each\n"
+"hardware tab; apply only the settings for the selected platform."
+msgstr ""
+"共有参数的含义请参阅[公共参数说明](#glm-common-"
+"parameters)。拓扑、各角色限制及连接器设置在对应硬件标签页中解释，请仅使用所选平台的配置。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Select the hardware tab below for the prefill and decode topology. Prefill "
+"and decode run on separate node groups and exchange KV cache through "
+"Mooncake."
+msgstr ""
+"请在下方选择对应硬件的标签页查看 Prefill 和 Decode 拓扑。两种角色运行在独立节点组，通过 Mooncake 传输 KV 缓存。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The ordinary PD examples use Mooncake for KV transfer between Prefill and\n"
+"Decode. KV pooling is configured separately in Section 5.1.4: all three\n"
+"hardware tabs combine Mooncake P-to-D transfer with an Ascend Store\n"
+"connector backed by MemCache. Follow each tab's connector version,\n"
+"layerwise setting and topology."
+msgstr ""
+"普通 PD 示例通过 Mooncake 在 Prefill 与 Decode 间传输 KV 缓存。第 5.1.4 节单独介绍 KV "
+"缓存池：三个硬件标签页均将 Mooncake 的 P-to-D 传输与采用 MemCache 后端的 Ascend Store "
+"连接器组合使用。请遵循各标签页中的连接器版本、逐层配置和拓扑。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Run the Prefill script on P0/P1. Decode uses four nodes, eight TP1 ranks per"
+" node (global ranks 0–31), not the previous two-node DP16 layout. Both roles"
+" declare DP32/TP1 in MooncakeConnectorV1. Prefill uses one MTP token; Decode"
+" uses five, a 60-token batch budget, and at most ten sequences per rank."
+msgstr ""
+"在 P0/P1 上运行 Prefill 脚本。Decode 使用 4 个节点，每节点运行 8 个 TP1 rank（全局 rank 为 "
+"0–31），不再使用原先两节点 DP16 布局。两个角色均在 MooncakeConnectorV1 中声明 DP32/TP1。Prefill 使用 1"
+" 个 MTP Token；Decode 使用 5 个 MTP Token，每个 rank 的批处理预算为 60 Token，最多 10 个序列。"
+
+msgid "1. prepare the script `launch_online_dp.py` on each Decode node:"
+msgstr "1. 在每个 Decode 节点上准备 `launch_online_dp.py` 脚本："
+
+msgid ""
+"Export the node-specific `MODEL_PATH`, `LOCAL_IP` and `NIC_NAME`, and the shared\n"
+"    `P0_IP` / `D0_IP` addresses before starting the corresponding node script."
+msgstr ""
+"启动相应节点脚本前，请导出本节点的 `MODEL_PATH`、`LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME`，以及共用的 `P0_IP` / `D0_IP`"
+" 地址。"
+
+msgid "###### Start the Proxy"
+msgstr "###### 启动代理"
+
+msgid ""
+"Reserve API ports, PP master port 7060 where applicable, DP RPC ports,\n"
+"    and connector-derived transfer/handshake ports. Base KV ports are P:30000\n"
+"    and D:30300 for ordinary PD/pooling, or D:30200 for 1M. Do not run multiple\n"
+"    scenarios simultaneously on the same devices or ports."
+msgstr ""
+"请预留 API 端口、适用时的 PP 主节点端口 7060、DP RPC 端口，以及连接器派生的传输和握手端口。普通 PD/缓存池的 KV 基础端口为 "
+"P:30000、D:30300；1M 场景的 Decode 端口为 D:30200。不要在相同设备或端口上同时运行多个场景。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Run the proxy on a separate host after all API endpoints are healthy.\n"
+"    Replace the host placeholders below. Do not register the headless Prefill\n"
+"    node as an API endpoint."
+msgstr "所有 API 端点就绪后，在独立主机上启动代理，并替换下方主机占位符。不要将无 API 服务的 Prefill 节点注册为 API 端点。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Use `glm` in requests to the proxy and follow Section 6 for smoke tests.\n"
+"    For pooling, additionally verify MemCache saves, remote loads and hit metrics\n"
+"    with repeated prefixes; a successful request alone is not evidence of pool\n"
+"    reuse. Validate long-context capacity and accuracy on the exact model/build\n"
+"    before increasing concurrency. No new measured results accompany these scripts."
+msgstr ""
+"向代理发送请求时使用 `glm`，并按第 6 节进行冒烟测试。缓存池场景还需通过重复前缀检查 MemCache "
+"保存、远程加载及命中指标；仅请求成功不能证明缓存池被复用。提高并发前，应在相同模型和构建版本上验证长上下文容量与精度。这些脚本没有附带新的实测结果。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` and `--tensor-parallel-size 8` define\n"
+"      the Prefill engine, with `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"42,36\"` across\n"
+"      two nodes. Only PP rank 0 exposes the Prefill API.\n"
+"    - The Decode launcher uses `--dp-size 32`, `--tp-size 1`, and\n"
+"      `--dp-size-local 8`: eight local ranks on each of four nodes.\n"
+"      `--dp-address` and `--dp-rpc-port` must match across Decode nodes;\n"
+"      `--dp-rank-start` assigns their disjoint global rank ranges.\n"
+"    - `--vllm-start-port 8000` assigns Decode API ports `8000-8007` on\n"
+"      each node. Register all 32 endpoints with the proxy.\n"
+"    - Both roles use `--max-model-len 135000`. Prefill sets\n"
+"      `--max-num-seqs 500` and `--max-num-batched-tokens 16384`;\n"
+"      Decode sets `10` and `60`, respectively, per engine.\n"
+"    - Both roles use FP8 attention and indexer KV caches. MTP uses\n"
+"      `deepseek_mtp` with an eager draft: one speculative token on Prefill\n"
+"      and five on Decode. Prefill uses `--enforce-eager`; Decode uses\n"
+"      `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode.\n"
+"    - `MooncakeConnectorV1` uses `kv_producer` on Prefill and `kv_consumer`\n"
+"      on Decode, with base KV ports `30000` and `30300`, respectively.\n"
+"      Both roles declare Prefill DP1/PP2/TP8 and Decode DP32/TP1.\n"
+"    - Prefill enables DSA CP, FlashComm1 and `enable_fused_mc2: 2`.\n"
+"      Decode enables MLAPO and shared-expert multistream overlap.\n"
+"      Both roles enable prefix caching and recomputation scheduling.\n"
+"    - `enable_fused_mc2: 2` selects MegaMoE when `cann_ops_transformer`\n"
+"      is installed. In the selected maintenance branch, MTP draft MoE\n"
+"      layers with an unsupported quantization layout use the non-fused\n"
+"      communication path. Keep the draft model's `enforce_eager: true`."
+msgstr ""
+"- `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` 与 `--tensor-parallel-size 8` 定义 Prefill 引擎，`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"42,36\"` 将层划分到两个节点，仅 PP rank 0 提供 Prefill API。\n"
+"    - Decode 启动器使用 `--dp-size 32`、`--tp-size 1` 和 `--dp-size-local 8`，在 4 个节点上各运行 8 个本地 rank。Decode 节点的 `--dp-address` 和 `--dp-rpc-port` 必须一致，`--dp-rank-start` 用于分配互不重叠的全局 rank 范围。\n"
+"    - `--vllm-start-port 8000` 为每节点分配 Decode API 端口 `8000-8007`，应将全部 32 个端点注册到代理。\n"
+"    - 两个角色均使用 `--max-model-len 135000`。Prefill 的 `--max-num-seqs 500`、`--max-num-batched-tokens 16384`；Decode 分别为 `10`、`60`，均按单引擎计算。\n"
+"    - 两个角色均使用 FP8 注意力及索引器 KV 缓存。MTP 使用 `deepseek_mtp` 和 eager 草稿模型，Prefill 使用 1 个推测 Token，Decode 使用 5 个。Prefill 设置 `--enforce-eager`，Decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式。\n"
+"    - `MooncakeConnectorV1` 在 Prefill 使用 `kv_producer`，在 Decode 使用 `kv_consumer`，KV 基础端口分别为 `30000`、`30300`；两端均声明 Prefill DP1/PP2/TP8、Decode DP32/TP1。\n"
+"    - Prefill 启用 DSA CP、FlashComm1 和 `enable_fused_mc2: 2`；Decode 启用 MLAPO 及共享专家多流重叠执行。两者均启用前缀缓存和重计算调度。\n"
+"    - 安装 `cann_ops_transformer` 后，`enable_fused_mc2: 2` 选择 MegaMoE。所选维护分支中，不支持的 MTP 草稿 MoE 量化布局使用非融合通信路径；请保留草稿模型的 `enforce_eager: true`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"This A3 reference serves GLM-5.3 W8A8C8 with a **200,000-token** maximum\n"
+"    sequence length for the 198k workload. It uses one Prefill engine spanning\n"
+"    P0/P1 with TP16 and PP2, and sixteen TP2 Decode engines on D0/D1.\n"
+"    Section 5.1.4 adds MemCache KV pooling to the same deployment."
+msgstr ""
+"本 A3 参考配置使用 GLM-5.3 W8A8C8，为 198k 负载设置 **200,000 Token** 的序列长度上限。一个 TP16/PP2"
+" Prefill 引擎跨 P0/P1 运行，D0/D1 上合计运行 16 个 TP2 Decode 引擎。第 5.1.4 节在同一部署上增加 "
+"MemCache KV 缓存池。"
+
+msgid ""
+"These scripts incorporate the supplied 198k PD+PP configuration; no new\n"
+"    runtime, accuracy, or performance validation is implied. The 200,000-token\n"
+"    limit covers the entire sequence, including generated tokens. Use the\n"
+"    GLM-5.3 W8A8C8 A3 checkpoint; these settings are not a GLM-5.2 validation.\n"
+"    Local weight/Python paths are placeholders, and API port 8000 and model\n"
+"    name `glm` are retained for consistency with the launcher and proxy.\n"
+"    The source's optional profiler output path is omitted from normal serving.\n"
+"    To profile, add `--profiler-config` with a writable directory on each node."
+msgstr ""
+"这些脚本采用所提供的 198k PD+PP 配置，不代表新增的运行、精度或性能验证。200,000 Token 的限制包含整条序列及生成的输出。请使用 "
+"GLM-5.3 W8A8C8 A3 权重；该配置不构成 GLM-5.2 的验证。本地权重和 Python 路径均为占位符，API 端口保留为 "
+"8000、模型服务名保留为 `glm`，以与启动器和代理保持一致。常规服务不包含来源配置中的可选性能分析输出路径；如需分析，请在各节点通过 "
+"`--profiler-config` 指定可写目录。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The HCCS-only `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` and communication resource\n"
+"    version `1.2` are retained from the source. Confirm that the target CANN\n"
+"    stack and inter-node fabric support them before launch; do not apply this\n"
+"    transport restriction to an unsupported network. Decode retains\n"
+"    `LOCAL_WORLD_SIZE=16` and OpenMP settings from the source. Check static-kernel\n"
+"    compatibility with the selected build and TP2 worker layout. Fused MC2 mode\n"
+"    selection is version-dependent; confirm the effective mode in startup logs."
+msgstr ""
+"本例保留来源配置中仅适用于 HCCS 的 `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` 和通信资源版本 `1.2`。启动前请确认目标 "
+"CANN 软件栈及节点间网络支持这些设置，不要在不支持的网络上使用此传输限制。Decode 保留来源中的 `LOCAL_WORLD_SIZE=16` 和"
+" OpenMP 设置。请检查静态内核与所选构建、TP2 工作进程布局的兼容性。融合 MC2 模式选择与版本有关，应通过启动日志确认实际生效模式。"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Role | Nodes | Global DP | TP | PP | Placement | Devices per role |\n"
+"    | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
+"    | Prefill | P0, P1 | 1 | 16 | 2 | One PP stage per node | 32 |\n"
+"    | Decode | D0, D1 | 16 | 2 | 1 | Eight DP ranks per node | 32 |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 角色 | 节点 | 全局 DP | TP | PP | 部署方式 | 每个角色的设备数 |\n"
+"    | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
+"    | Prefill | P0, P1 | 1 | 16 | 2 | 每节点一个 PP 阶段 | 32 |\n"
+"    | Decode | D0, D1 | 16 | 2 | 1 | 每节点 8 个 DP rank | 32 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"Each container exposes devices 0-15. P0 exposes the only Prefill API;\n"
+"    P1 runs the second PP stage without an API server. Decode ranks 0-7 run\n"
+"    on D0 and ranks 8-15 on D1, with API ports 8000-8007 on each node."
+msgstr ""
+"每个容器提供设备 0–15。P0 提供唯一的 Prefill API；P1 运行第二个 PP 阶段，不提供 API 服务。Decode rank 0–7"
+" 位于 D0，rank 8–15 位于 D1，各节点的 API 端口为 8000–8007。"
+
+msgid "Use the A3 image selected in Section 4 on all four nodes."
+msgstr "4 个节点均使用第 4 节选择的 A3 镜像。"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. Prepare the same weights and software on all four nodes. Set `MODEL_PATH`\n"
+"       and `PYTHON_LIB_DIR` in each role script to the installed paths. Install\n"
+"       `fastokens` on Prefill nodes for `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1`.\n"
+"    2. Verify [multi-node communication](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect).\n"
+"       Set `LOCAL_IP=\"<PREFILL_NODE_IP>\"` on each Prefill node and\n"
+"       `LOCAL_IP=\"<DECODE_NODE_IP>\"` on each Decode node to that node's IP.\n"
+"       Set `NIC_NAME=\"<NETWORK_INTERFACE>\"` to its matching interface and\n"
+"       `MODEL_PATH=\"<YOUR_MODEL_PATH>\"` to its model weight directory.\n"
+"    3. Reserve the PP master port 7060, Decode DP RPC port 16600, API ports,\n"
+"       proxy port 8000, and the topology-derived Mooncake transfer/handshake ports.\n"
+"       Prefill and Decode run on separate node groups.\n"
+"    4. Keep the 78-layer PP partition `42,36` consistent in the Prefill\n"
+"       environment and both roles' connector topology. Both roles explicitly\n"
+"       use int8 KV cache and int8 indexer KV cache for these W8A8C8 weights."
+msgstr ""
+"1. 在全部 4 个节点准备相同权重及软件。将各角色脚本中的 `MODEL_PATH` 和 `PYTHON_LIB_DIR` 设置为实际安装路径。在 Prefill 节点安装 `fastokens`，以使用 `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1`。\n"
+"    2. 验证[多节点通信](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect)。各 Prefill 节点设置 `LOCAL_IP=\"<PREFILL_NODE_IP>\"`，各 Decode 节点设置 `LOCAL_IP=\"<DECODE_NODE_IP>\"`，均指向本节点 IP。将 `NIC_NAME=\"<NETWORK_INTERFACE>\"` 设为对应网卡，将 `MODEL_PATH=\"<YOUR_MODEL_PATH>\"` 设为模型权重目录。\n"
+"    3. 预留 PP 主节点端口 7060、Decode DP RPC 端口 16600、API 端口、代理端口 8000，以及按拓扑派生的 Mooncake 传输和握手端口。Prefill 与 Decode 运行在独立节点组上。\n"
+"    4. Prefill 环境与两端连接器拓扑中的 78 层 PP 划分 `42,36` 必须一致。两端均为 W8A8C8 权重显式使用 int8 注意力及索引器 KV 缓存。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Replace each node's IP and installation-path placeholders before starting.\n"
+"    Run the four commands in [Start the Engines](#glm53-pd-a3-start) in\n"
+"    separate terminals. Keep the master processes running while the other\n"
+"    nodes join; start both nodes of each group before waiting for the group\n"
+"    to become healthy."
+msgstr ""
+"启动前请替换各节点 IP 和安装路径占位符。在独立终端执行[启动引擎](#glm53-pd-a3-start)中的 4 "
+"条命令。其他节点加入时保持主进程运行；每组的两个节点全部启动后，再等待该组就绪。"
+
+msgid ""
+"After the Prefill API on P0:8000 and all sixteen Decode APIs respond\n"
+"    to `GET /v1/models`, start the\n"
+"    [PD load-balancing proxy](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)\n"
+"    from the matching checkout on a separate host that can reach all P/D\n"
+"    API endpoints. The proxy listens on port 8000; using a separate host\n"
+"    avoids a port conflict with P0:8000 and the Decode APIs on 8000-8007.\n"
+"    Register P0 once and all sixteen Decode endpoints. P1 is not a separate\n"
+"    Prefill API endpoint."
+msgstr ""
+"P0:8000 的 Prefill API 与全部 16 个 Decode API 均能响应 `GET /v1/models` 后，在可访问全部 P/D"
+" API 的独立主机上，从匹配的代码版本启动 [PD 负载均衡代理](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
+"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)。代理监听"
+" 8000 端口；使用独立主机可避免与 P0:8000 及 Decode 的 8000–8007 端口冲突。P0 注册一次，并注册全部 16 个 "
+"Decode 端点。P1 不是独立的 Prefill API 端点。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- Prefill uses TP16/PP2 over two nodes with the `mp` executor and\n"
+"      `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"42,36\"`. Its batch budget is 16,384 tokens,\n"
+"      maximum sequence count is 64, and it runs in eager mode with one MTP token.\n"
+"    - Decode uses DP16/TP2, a 256-token batch budget, 64 sequences, five MTP\n"
+"      tokens with an eager draft model, and `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode.\n"
+"      `recompute_scheduler_enable=true` allows recomputation scheduling.\n"
+"    - Both roles retain chunked prefill, async scheduling, seed 1024, and\n"
+"      memory utilization 0.92. Prefill enables prefix caching, DSA CP,\n"
+"      FlashComm1, `enable_fused_mc2=2`, and `enable_shared_expert_dp=true`.\n"
+"      Non-pooled Decode disables prefix caching and uses NPU graph/static-kernel\n"
+"      compilation with shared-expert multistream overlap, without fused MC2.\n"
+"      Both use `glm47` tool and reasoning parsers and the served model name `glm`.\n"
+"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` declares the same Prefill DP1/PP2/TP16 and\n"
+"      Decode DP16/TP2 topology on both sides. The non-pooled base KV ports\n"
+"      are 30000 on Prefill and 30100 on Decode; reserve derived worker ports.\n"
+"    - The examples give Prefill and each Decode engine distinct `engine_id`\n"
+"      values so P-to-D peer registration cannot conflict."
+msgstr ""
+"- Prefill 通过 `mp` 执行器以 TP16/PP2 跨两个节点运行，设置 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"42,36\"`。批处理预算为 16,384 Token，最大序列数为 64，以 eager 模式运行，使用 1 个 MTP Token。\n"
+"    - Decode 使用 DP16/TP2、256 Token 批处理预算、64 个序列及 5 个 MTP Token；草稿模型为 eager 模式，主模型使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式。`recompute_scheduler_enable=true` 允许重计算调度。\n"
+"    - 两端均保留分块 Prefill、异步调度、随机种子 1024 和 0.92 的内存利用率。Prefill 启用前缀缓存、DSA CP、FlashComm1、`enable_fused_mc2=2` 及 `enable_shared_expert_dp=true`。非缓存池 Decode 禁用前缀缓存，使用 NPU 图和静态内核编译及共享专家多流重叠执行，不启用融合 MC2。两端工具调用与推理解析器均使用 `glm47`，模型服务名为 `glm`。\n"
+"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` 两端均声明 Prefill DP1/PP2/TP16、Decode DP16/TP2。非缓存池 KV 基础端口分别为 Prefill 30000、Decode 30100，还需预留派生的工作进程端口。\n"
+"    - 示例为 Prefill 和各 Decode 引擎设置不同的 `engine_id`，以避免 P-to-D 节点注册冲突。"
+
+msgid "###### Eight-Node Deployment"
+msgstr "###### 八节点部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"This reference deploys GLM-5.3 W8A8C8 on eight A2 series (64GB × 8)\n"
+"    nodes. Use the A2 image and container command from Section 4. Both roles enable expert\n"
+"    parallelism to distribute the MoE expert weights across their DP × TP ranks."
+msgstr ""
+"本参考在 8 个 A2 系列（64GB × 8）节点上部署 GLM-5.3 W8A8C8，使用第 4 节的 A2 镜像和容器命令。两端均启用专家并行，将"
+" MoE 专家权重分布到 DP × TP rank 上。"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Role | Nodes | Global DP | TP | PP | Placement | Devices per role |\n"
+"    | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
+"    | Prefill | P0-P3 | 2 | 16 | 1 | Rank 0 spans P0/P1; rank 1 spans P2/P3 | 32 |\n"
+"    | Decode | D0-D3 | 16 | 2 | 1 | Four DP ranks per node, starting at 0/4/8/12 | 32 |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 角色 | 节点 | 全局 DP | TP | PP | 部署方式 | 每个角色的设备数 |\n"
+"    | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
+"    | Prefill | P0-P3 | 2 | 16 | 1 | rank 0 跨 P0/P1；rank 1 跨 P2/P3 | 32 |\n"
+"    | Decode | D0-D3 | 16 | 2 | 1 | 每节点 4 个 DP rank，起始值为 0/4/8/12 | 32 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"P0 exposes the only Prefill API on port 8077; P1-P3 are headless.\n"
+"    Decode exposes ports 10010-10013 on each node. Prefill uses the `mp`\n"
+"    executor with `--nnodes 4`; Decode uses a launcher to start one TP2\n"
+"    engine per DP rank. Both roles pin the V1 model runner and use int8\n"
+"    attention and indexer KV caches. This deployment has no pipeline\n"
+"    parallelism; the [A2 pooling topology in Section 5.1.3](#glm53-pool-a2) is different."
+msgstr ""
+"P0 通过 8077 端口提供唯一的 Prefill API；P1–P3 不提供 API。Decode 在各节点开放 10010–10013 "
+"端口。Prefill 使用 `mp` 执行器和 `--nnodes 4`；Decode 使用启动器为每个 DP rank 启动一个 TP2 "
+"引擎。两端固定使用 V1 模型运行器和 int8 注意力及索引器 KV 缓存。本部署不使用流水线并行，与[第 5.1.3 节的 A2 "
+"缓存池拓扑](#glm53-pool-a2)不同。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Prepare identical weights and software on all eight nodes, verify\n"
+"    [multi-node communication](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect),\n"
+"    and set the model path, node IP, and network interface in each script.\n"
+"    Install `fastokens` on every Prefill node for `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1`.\n"
+"    Reserve Prefill master port 29501, Prefill DP RPC port 12980, Decode\n"
+"    DP RPC port 12990, the API and proxy ports, and Mooncake ports derived\n"
+"    from base ports 30000 on Prefill and 30100 on Decode."
+msgstr ""
+"在全部 8 "
+"个节点准备相同权重和软件，验证[多节点通信](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-"
+"multi-node-interconnect)，并在各脚本设置模型路径、节点 IP 和网卡。在每个 Prefill 节点安装 "
+"`fastokens`，以使用 `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1`。预留 Prefill 主节点端口 29501、Prefill DP RPC"
+" 端口 12980、Decode DP RPC 端口 12990、API 与代理端口，以及从 Prefill 30000、Decode 30100 "
+"基础端口派生的 Mooncake 端口。"
+
+msgid "###### Prepare the Decode DP Launcher"
+msgstr "###### 准备 Decode DP 启动器"
+
+msgid ""
+"Save the following A2 launcher as `launch_online_dp.py` on all Decode\n"
+"    nodes. It allocates disjoint local device lists within the eight devices\n"
+"    exposed by each A2 container. Arguments `$1`-`$7` passed to the engine\n"
+"    script are visible devices, API port, global DP size, DP rank, DP master\n"
+"    IP, DP RPC port, and TP size. Prefill is started directly with `vllm serve`."
+msgstr ""
+"将以下 A2 启动器保存为各 Decode 节点的 `launch_online_dp.py`。它在每个 A2 容器提供的 8 "
+"个设备内分配互不重叠的本地设备列表。传给引擎脚本的 `$1`–`$7` 依次为可见设备、API 端口、全局 DP 大小、DP rank、DP 主节点 "
+"IP、DP RPC 端口及 TP 大小。Prefill 直接通过 `vllm serve` 启动。"
+
+msgid "###### Prefill Engine Script"
+msgstr "###### Prefill 引擎脚本"
+
+msgid ""
+"Save this script as `start_p_engine.sh` on P0-P3. Set `P_MASTER_IP` to\n"
+"    P0's IP in every copy and `NIC_NAME` to the current node's interface.\n"
+"    The command-line arguments select the node rank, API port, local IP,\n"
+"    and visible devices."
+msgstr ""
+"在 P0–P3 将本脚本保存为 `start_p_engine.sh`。每份脚本都将 `P_MASTER_IP` 设为 P0 的 "
+"IP，`NIC_NAME` 设为本节点网卡。命令行参数分别指定节点 rank、API 端口、本地 IP 和可见设备。"
+
+msgid ""
+"If the installed Mooncake worker rejects a missing local DP rank, see\n"
+"    [Local DP Rank Compatibility and Troubleshooting](#glm53-a2-rc1-compatibility)\n"
+"    and check the active vLLM-Ascend installation on every Prefill node\n"
+"    before starting the group."
+msgstr ""
+"如果所安装的 Mooncake 工作进程因缺少本地 DP rank 而拒绝启动，请参阅[本地 DP rank "
+"兼容性与故障排查](#glm53-a2-rc1-compatibility)，并在启动整个节点组前检查每个 Prefill 节点实际使用的 vLLM-"
+"Ascend 安装。"
+
+msgid "###### Decode Engine Script"
+msgstr "###### Decode 引擎脚本"
+
+msgid ""
+"Save this script as `start_d_engine.sh` on D0-D3. Configure the current\n"
+"    node's `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, and `MODEL_PATH` in each copy. The launcher\n"
+"    supplies `$1`-`$7`, including the device list for each TP2 engine."
+msgstr ""
+"在 D0–D3 将本脚本保存为 `start_d_engine.sh`，并分别配置当前节点的 `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME` 和 "
+"`MODEL_PATH`。启动器传入 `$1`–`$7`，其中包含每个 TP2 引擎的设备列表。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Both sides declare the same topology and use `MooncakeConnectorV2` for\n"
+"    this non-uniform DP × TP layout. Prefill and Decode use different\n"
+"    `engine_id` values; each independently launched Decode engine includes\n"
+"    its global DP rank in its ID."
+msgstr ""
+"两端声明相同拓扑，并为此非对称 DP × TP 布局使用 `MooncakeConnectorV2`。Prefill 与 Decode 使用不同的 "
+"`engine_id`，各独立启动的 Decode 引擎在 ID 中包含自己的全局 DP rank。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Run the Decode commands on their respective nodes in separate terminals.\n"
+"    Start all four nodes before waiting for the DP group to become ready."
+msgstr "在各自节点的独立终端运行 Decode 命令。4 个节点全部启动后，再等待 DP 组就绪。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start Prefill on P0, then P2, P1, and P3. Run each command on its target\n"
+"    node, keeping the master process running while the other nodes join."
+msgstr "按 P0、P2、P1、P3 的顺序启动 Prefill。各命令在对应节点运行，其他节点加入时保持主进程运行。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Wait for P0:8077 and all sixteen Decode APIs on ports 10010-10013 to\n"
+"    answer `GET /v1/models`. Confirm in the logs that P1-P3 have joined;\n"
+"    headless nodes do not expose HTTP APIs. When HTTP proxy variables are\n"
+"    set, use `curl --noproxy '*'` for business-IP checks to avoid proxy\n"
+"    interception and HTTP 403 responses. For example, check P0 as follows,\n"
+"    then check each Decode endpoint in the same way:"
+msgstr ""
+"等待 P0:8077 和全部 16 个 Decode API（每节点端口 10010–10013）响应 `GET /v1/models`。通过日志确认 "
+"P1–P3 已加入，它们不提供 HTTP API。若配置了 HTTP 代理变量，请使用 `curl --noproxy '*'` 检查业务 "
+"IP，避免代理拦截和 HTTP 403 响应。例如先检查下方 P0，再以相同方式检查各 Decode 端点："
+
+msgid ""
+"Start the load-balancing proxy on P0 or a host that can reach all\n"
+"    endpoints. Clear inherited proxy settings before starting it:"
+msgstr "在 P0 或可访问全部端点的主机上启动负载均衡代理。启动前清除继承的代理设置："
+
+msgid ""
+"Check the proxy and send requests with model name `glm5`, explicitly\n"
+"    bypassing any client-side HTTP proxy:"
+msgstr "检查代理并使用模型名 `glm5` 发送请求，显式绕过客户端 HTTP 代理："
+
+msgid ""
+"Both roles use a 135,000-token maximum length, memory utilization 0.92,\n"
+"    and three MTP tokens. Prefill uses eager mode, an 8192-token batch budget,\n"
+"    64 sequences, DSA CP, and FlashComm1. Decode uses a 256-token\n"
+"    batch budget, 32 sequences, `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graphs, sparse C8 options,\n"
+"    and recomputation scheduling."
+msgstr ""
+"两端均使用 135,000 Token 长度上限、0.92 内存利用率和 3 个 MTP Token。Prefill 采用 eager "
+"模式，批处理预算为 8192 Token，最多 64 个序列，并启用 DSA CP 和 FlashComm1。Decode 的批处理预算为 256 "
+"Token，最多 32 个序列，使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图、稀疏 C8 选项及重计算调度。"
+
+msgid "###### Local DP Rank Compatibility and Troubleshooting"
+msgstr "###### 本地 DP rank 兼容性与故障排查"
+
+msgid ""
+"If Prefill fails during Mooncake KV cache registration with\n"
+"    `ValueError: Mooncake worker requires a local DP rank`, first verify that\n"
+"    `--data-parallel-size-local 1` is present in `start_p_engine.sh`.\n"
+"    P0/P1 form global DP rank 0 and P2/P3 form global DP rank 1; each node\n"
+"    has one local DP rank. Even with that option, multi-node TP\n"
+"    headless workers may receive `data_parallel_rank_local=None`."
+msgstr ""
+"如果 Prefill 在注册 Mooncake KV 缓存时出现 `ValueError: Mooncake worker requires a "
+"local DP rank`，请先确认 `start_p_engine.sh` 中存在 `--data-parallel-size-local "
+"1`。P0/P1 组成全局 DP rank 0，P2/P3 组成全局 DP rank 1，每节点一个本地 DP rank。即使设置了此选项，跨节点 TP"
+" 的无 API 工作进程仍可能收到 `data_parallel_rank_local=None`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"If the installed worker still contains the unconditional `None` check\n"
+"    shown below, apply the following change to\n"
+"    `vllm_ascend/distributed/kv_transfer/kv_p2p/mooncake/base_worker.py`\n"
+"    in the vLLM-Ascend installation used by **every Prefill node** before\n"
+"    launching the scripts. It infers local rank 0 only when\n"
+"    `data_parallel_size_local == 1`; multiple-local-rank configurations\n"
+"    still require an explicit local rank."
+msgstr ""
+"如果安装的工作进程仍包含下方无条件的 `None` 检查，请在启动脚本前，对**每个 Prefill 节点**实际使用的 vLLM-Ascend "
+"安装中的 `vllm_ascend/distributed/kv_transfer/kv_p2p/mooncake/base_worker.py` "
+"应用以下修改。仅在 `data_parallel_size_local == 1` 时推断本地 rank 为 0；配置多个本地 rank "
+"时仍要求显式指定。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The same check and conditional fix apply to the pooled Prefill PP\n"
+"    headless workers in the [A2 pooling tab of Section 5.1.3](#glm53-pool-a2).\n"
+"    Confirm that the active Python package contains the change on every\n"
+"    Prefill node, then start all members of the Prefill group before waiting\n"
+"    for it to become ready."
+msgstr ""
+"[第 5.1.3 节 A2 缓存池标签页](#glm53-pool-a2)中的 Prefill PP 无 API "
+"工作进程也适用相同检查和条件修复。请确认各 Prefill 节点实际加载的 Python 包包含修改，先启动 Prefill "
+"组的全部成员，再等待其就绪。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The supplied A2 deployment validation record dated 2026-10-15 reports\n"
+"    the following results with the explicit local-DP setting and rc1 fix:"
+msgstr "提供的 2026-10-15 A2 部署验证记录在显式配置本地 DP 并应用 rc1 修复后，报告了以下结果："
+
+msgid ""
+"| Check | Recorded result |\n"
+"    | --- | --- |\n"
+"    | Smoke request | HTTP 200; answer `84` |\n"
+"    | GSM8K requests / successful / failed | 200 / 200 / 0 |\n"
+"    | Elapsed time for the 200-request run | 105.324 seconds |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 检查项 | 记录结果 |\n"
+"    | --- | --- |\n"
+"    | 冒烟请求 | HTTP 200；回答为 `84` |\n"
+"    | GSM8K 请求 / 成功 / 失败 | 200 / 200 / 0 |\n"
+"    | 200 次请求运行耗时 | 105.324 秒 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"The request counts report successful completion, not an accuracy score."
+msgstr "请求计数表示成功完成的次数，不是精度分数。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.1.4 MemCache KV Cache Pool Deployment"
+msgstr "#### 5.1.4 MemCache KV 缓存池部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"Select the tab that matches the deployment hardware and its Prefill "
+"topology."
+msgstr "请选择与部署硬件及其 Prefill 拓扑匹配的标签页。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Complete [MemCache backend "
+"setup](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-"
+"backend) first, including the metadata service, dependencies and per-node "
+"configuration. Export `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` to the actual configuration "
+"file on every node and make the installed MemCache libraries available to "
+"the vLLM Python runtime."
+msgstr ""
+"请先完成 [MemCache "
+"后端配置](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-"
+"backend)，包括元数据服务、依赖及各节点配置。在每个节点将 `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 导出为实际配置文件路径，并确保 "
+"vLLM 的 Python 运行环境能够加载已安装的 MemCache 库。"
+
+msgid ""
+"This source uses **W4A4C8 MXFP4**, a 1,048,576-token limit, and layerwise "
+"pooling (`use_layerwise=true`) through MultiConnector, MooncakeConnectorV2 "
+"and AscendStoreConnector. It is not the A3 198k non-layerwise configuration."
+" Both roles enable prefix caching. The source does not explicitly set "
+"`use_ascend_direct` for pooling; verify the selected build's default and "
+"backend transport rather than assuming the non-pooled setting. Decode needs "
+"four nodes with four TP2 ranks per node. Do not infer 1M capacity from the "
+"earlier single-node short-request W4A4C8 test."
+msgstr ""
+"此来源配置使用 **W4A4C8 MXFP4**，长度上限为 1,048,576 Token，通过 "
+"MultiConnector、MooncakeConnectorV2 和 AscendStoreConnector "
+"实现逐层缓存池（`use_layerwise=true`），与 A3 的 198k 非逐层配置不同。两端均启用前缀缓存。来源配置未显式设置缓存池的 "
+"`use_ascend_direct`，请检查所选构建的默认值及后端传输方式，不要假定与非缓存池配置相同。Decode 需要 4 个节点，每节点 4 个"
+" TP2 rank。不要根据之前的单节点短请求 W4A4C8 测试推断 1M 容量。"
+
+msgid "Use the [950DT DP launcher](#glm-950-dp-launcher) from Section 5.1.3."
+msgstr "使用第 5.1.3 节的 [950DT DP 启动器](#glm-950-dp-launcher)。"
+
+msgid "Start MemCache and complete its configuration on all nodes first."
+msgstr "先启动 MemCache，并完成所有节点的配置。"
+
+msgid "Run the proxy on a separate host after all API endpoints are healthy."
+msgstr "所有 API 端点就绪后，在独立主机上运行代理。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` and `--tensor-parallel-size 8` define\n"
+"      Prefill across two nodes, with `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"42,36\"`.\n"
+"      Only PP rank 0 exposes the Prefill API.\n"
+"    - The Decode launcher uses `--dp-size 16`, `--tp-size 2`, and\n"
+"      `--dp-size-local 4` across four nodes. Each node exposes API ports\n"
+"      `8000-8003`; register all 16 endpoints with the proxy.\n"
+"    - Both roles use `--max-model-len 1048576`. Prefill sets\n"
+"      `--max-num-seqs 8` and `--max-num-batched-tokens 4096`;\n"
+"      Decode sets `10` and `60`, respectively, per engine.\n"
+"    - Both roles enable prefix caching and FP8 attention and indexer KV\n"
+"      caches. MTP uses an eager draft with one speculative token on\n"
+"      Prefill and five on Decode. Prefill runs in eager mode; Decode uses\n"
+"      `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode.\n"
+"    - `MultiConnector` combines `MooncakeConnectorV2` for P-to-D transfer\n"
+"      with `AscendStoreConnector` for KV pooling. Both roles declare\n"
+"      Prefill DP1/PP2/TP8 and Decode DP16/TP2, and set `use_layerwise: true`.\n"
+"      Mooncake base KV ports are `30000` on Prefill and `30300` on Decode.\n"
+"    - `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` selects each node's MemCache configuration.\n"
+"      Prepare the backend before starting the engines and verify shared\n"
+"      pool reuse through its hit/load metrics.\n"
+"    - Prefill enables DSA CP, FlashComm1 and `enable_fused_mc2: 1`.\n"
+"      Decode enables MLAPO and shared-expert multistream overlap.\n"
+"      Both roles enable recomputation scheduling."
+msgstr ""
+"- `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size 8` 定义跨两个节点的 Prefill，设置 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"42,36\"`，仅 PP rank 0 提供 Prefill API。\n"
+"    - Decode 启动器在 4 个节点上使用 `--dp-size 16`、`--tp-size 2` 和 `--dp-size-local 4`，每节点开放 API 端口 `8000-8003`；请将全部 16 个端点注册到代理。\n"
+"    - 两端均使用 `--max-model-len 1048576`。Prefill 设置 `--max-num-seqs 8`、`--max-num-batched-tokens 4096`；Decode 每引擎分别设置 `10`、`60`。\n"
+"    - 两端均启用前缀缓存和 FP8 注意力及索引器 KV 缓存。MTP 使用 eager 草稿模型，Prefill 采用 1 个推测 Token，Decode 采用 5 个。Prefill 以 eager 模式运行，Decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式。\n"
+"    - `MultiConnector` 组合 `MooncakeConnectorV2` 的 P-to-D 传输与 `AscendStoreConnector` 的 KV 缓存池，两端均声明 Prefill DP1/PP2/TP8、Decode DP16/TP2，并设置 `use_layerwise: true`。Mooncake 的 KV 基础端口在 Prefill 为 `30000`，在 Decode 为 `30300`。\n"
+"    - `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 指定各节点的 MemCache 配置。启动引擎前应准备好后端，并通过命中和加载指标验证共享池复用。\n"
+"    - Prefill 启用 DSA CP、FlashComm1 和 `enable_fused_mc2: 1`；Decode 启用 MLAPO 及共享专家多流重叠执行，两端均启用重计算调度。"
+
+msgid ""
+"This extends the same four-node PP/PD topology with `MultiConnector`:\n"
+"    `MooncakeConnectorV2` transfers KV cache from Prefill to Decode, and\n"
+"    `AscendStoreConnector` provides non-layerwise MemCache pooling. Retain\n"
+"    the launcher, PP placement, and proxy routing from the A3 tab of Section 5.1.3.\n"
+"    This is the supplied 198k pooled variant, with `--max-model-len 200000`.\n"
+"    Both roles enable prefix caching; unlike the non-pooled variant, Decode\n"
+"    must not use `--no-enable-prefix-caching`. Prefill retains fused MC2 mode 2\n"
+"    and shared-expert DP, while Decode uses NPU graph/static-kernel compilation\n"
+"    and shared-expert multistream overlap without fused MC2. The same build,\n"
+"    HCCS fabric, and static-kernel compatibility checks apply. Pool-specific\n"
+"    `PYTHONHASHSEED=0`, `ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`, and MemCache paths are set below."
+msgstr ""
+"本配置在同一四节点 PP/PD 拓扑上增加 `MultiConnector`：`MooncakeConnectorV2` 在 Prefill 与 "
+"Decode 间传输 KV 缓存，`AscendStoreConnector` 提供非逐层 MemCache 缓存池。沿用第 5.1.3 节 A3 "
+"标签页的启动器、PP 布局和代理路由。这是提供的 198k 缓存池变体，使用 `--max-model-len "
+"200000`。两端均启用前缀缓存；与非缓存池变体不同，Decode 不能使用 `--no-enable-prefix-caching`。Prefill"
+" 保留融合 MC2 模式 2 和共享专家 DP；Decode 使用 NPU 图和静态内核编译及共享专家多流重叠执行，不启用融合 "
+"MC2。构建版本、HCCS 网络和静态内核兼容性检查要求相同。下方配置缓存池专用的 "
+"`PYTHONHASHSEED=0`、`ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1` 及 MemCache 路径。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Complete [MemCache backend setup](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend),\n"
+"    including the hardware/CANN prerequisites, `memfabric-hybrid` and\n"
+"    `memcache-hybrid` installation, configuration files, and metadata service.\n"
+"    All P/D instances must access the same pool; connector arguments do not\n"
+"    start the MemCache service. Set `MEMCACHE_ROOT` to the installed\n"
+"    `memcache_hybrid` directory and `PYTHON_LIB_DIR` to the library directory\n"
+"    of the Python installation actually used by vLLM on each node."
+msgstr ""
+"请完成 [MemCache "
+"后端配置](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-"
+"backend)，包括硬件/CANN 前置条件、`memfabric-hybrid` 和 `memcache-hybrid` "
+"安装、配置文件及元数据服务。全部 P/D 实例必须访问同一缓存池，连接器参数不会启动 MemCache 服务。各节点将 `MEMCACHE_ROOT` "
+"设为已安装的 `memcache_hybrid` 目录，将 `PYTHON_LIB_DIR` 设为 vLLM 实际使用的 Python 安装的库目录。"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. prepare the script `launch_online_dp.py` on each Decode node, using the\n"
+"       launcher in [Prepare the Scripts](#glm53-pd-a3-scripts)."
+msgstr ""
+"1. 使用[准备脚本](#glm53-pd-a3-scripts)中的启动器，在每个 Decode 节点准备 "
+"`launch_online_dp.py`。"
+
+msgid "2. prepare the pooled script `run_dp_template.sh` on each node."
+msgstr "2. 在每个节点准备缓存池脚本 `run_dp_template.sh`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The pooled configuration uses base KV ports 30000 on Prefill and\n"
+"    30200 on Decode. The outer `engine_id` is unique per engine and is\n"
+"    inherited by the child connectors. This differs from the supplied pooled\n"
+"    reference's repeated `\"0\"` IDs to avoid Mooncake peer identity conflicts.\n"
+"    `lookup_rpc_port=\"0\"` is retained: Ascend Store uses an IPC endpoint that\n"
+"    also includes the DP rank, and P/D run on separate hosts. It is not a TCP\n"
+"    listener on port zero. `backend=\"memcache\"` and `use_layerwise=false`\n"
+"    are set on both sides."
+msgstr ""
+"缓存池配置的 KV 基础端口为 Prefill 30000、Decode 30200。外层 `engine_id` "
+"对每个引擎唯一，并由子连接器继承；与来源参考重复使用 `\"0\"` 不同，以避免 Mooncake 节点身份冲突。保留 "
+"`lookup_rpc_port=\"0\"`：Ascend Store 使用同时包含 DP rank 的 IPC 端点，P/D "
+"运行在不同主机上，并非在 TCP 零端口监听。两端均设置 `backend=\"memcache\"` 和 `use_layerwise=false`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start the MemCache metadata service and complete its configuration on all\n"
+"    four nodes before starting vLLM."
+msgstr "启动 vLLM 前，请在全部 4 个节点启动 MemCache 元数据服务并完成配置。"
+
+msgid "###### Start the Proxy and Verify Pooling"
+msgstr "###### 启动代理并验证缓存池"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. Start the MemCache metadata service and complete its configuration on\n"
+"       all four nodes before starting vLLM.\n"
+"    2. Start P0, P1, D0, and D1 with the commands in\n"
+"       [Start the Engines](#glm53-pool-a3-start). Both Prefill scripts\n"
+"       already specify port 8000.\n"
+"    3. Wait for P0:8000 and all sixteen Decode APIs to become healthy. Start\n"
+"       the [A3 PD proxy](#glm53-pd-a3-proxy) on a separate host, using the same\n"
+"       Prefill endpoint and Decode ports 8000-8007. Its public port is 8000.\n"
+"    4. Send requests to the proxy using the served model name `glm`:"
+msgstr ""
+"1. 启动 vLLM 前，在全部 4 个节点启动 MemCache 元数据服务并完成配置。\n"
+"    2. 使用[启动引擎](#glm53-pool-a3-start)中的命令启动 P0、P1、D0、D1。两个 Prefill 脚本均已指定端口 8000。\n"
+"    3. 等待 P0:8000 和全部 16 个 Decode API 就绪。在独立主机上启动 [A3 PD 代理](#glm53-pd-a3-proxy)，使用相同 Prefill 端点及 Decode 端口 8000–8007；代理对外端口为 8000。\n"
+"    4. 使用模型服务名 `glm` 向代理发送请求："
+
+msgid ""
+"For either mode, check P/D logs for successful KV transfer. For pooling,\n"
+"    also check MemCache initialization, then warm the pool with a prompt longer\n"
+"    than one cache block and repeat requests with the same prefix. Inspect\n"
+"    Ascend Store/MemCache saves, lookups, loads, and hit metrics. A successful\n"
+"    response or a local prefix-cache hit alone does not demonstrate shared pool\n"
+"    reuse; verify a pool load when the prefix is absent from the engine's local\n"
+"    cache. These A3 references do not\n"
+"    establish A2, 1M-context, or other parallel-layout support, and do not add\n"
+"    accuracy or performance claims for the 198k workload."
+msgstr ""
+"两种模式都需检查 P/D 日志，确认 KV 传输成功。缓存池模式还需检查 MemCache "
+"初始化，使用长度超过一个缓存块的提示词预热缓存池，再以相同前缀重复请求。检查 Ascend Store/MemCache "
+"的保存、查询、加载及命中指标。仅请求成功或本地前缀缓存命中不能证明共享池被复用；应确认引擎本地缓存中不存在该前缀时，能够从共享池加载。这些 A3 "
+"参考配置不代表支持 A2、1M 上下文或其他并行布局，也没有新增 198k 负载的精度或性能声明。"
+
+msgid "###### Eight-Node Deployment with MemCache KV Cache Pool"
+msgstr "###### 八节点 MemCache KV 缓存池部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"This A2 pooling reference uses four Prefill nodes and four Decode nodes,\n"
+"    with eight devices per node. Two independent Prefill instances each\n"
+"    span two nodes with TP8 × PP2. Each instance has DP size 1 and its own\n"
+"    API server; the proxy registers both instance leaders. Decode uses one\n"
+"    DP16 × TP2 group across four nodes."
+msgstr ""
+"本 A2 缓存池参考配置使用 4 个 Prefill 节点和 4 个 Decode 节点，每节点 8 个设备。两个独立 Prefill 实例分别以 "
+"TP8 × PP2 跨两个节点运行，每实例 DP 大小为 1，各有 API 服务，代理注册两个实例的主节点。Decode 使用横跨 4 个节点的一个 "
+"DP16 × TP2 组。"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Role | Nodes | Parallelism | Placement | Devices per role |\n"
+"    | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
+"    | Prefill | P0-P3 (2 instances) | TP8 × PP2 per instance | Instance 0 on P0/P1; instance 1 on P2/P3 | 32 |\n"
+"    | Decode | D0-D3 | DP16 × TP2 | Four local DP ranks per node, starting at 0/4/8/12 | 32 |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 角色 | 节点 | 并行配置 | 部署方式 | 每个角色的设备数 |\n"
+"    | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
+"    | Prefill | P0-P3（2 个实例） | 每实例 TP8 × PP2 | 实例 0 位于 P0/P1；实例 1 位于 P2/P3 | 32 |\n"
+"    | Decode | D0-D3 | DP16 × TP2 | 每节点 4 个本地 DP rank，起始值为 0/4/8/12 | 32 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"P0 and P2 expose APIs on port 8000; P1 and P3 are headless PP partners.\n"
+"    Decode exposes ports 8000-8003 on each node, and the proxy listens on\n"
+"    1999. This PP2 layout is separate from the non-pooled DP2 × TP16\n"
+"    Prefill layout in the [A2 PD tab of Section 5.1.2](#glm53-pd-a2).\n"
+"    Use the A2 image from Section 4 and the\n"
+"    [A2 Decode launcher](#glm53-pd-a2-launcher)."
+msgstr ""
+"P0 和 P2 在 8000 端口提供 API；P1 和 P3 是不提供 API 的 PP 配对节点。Decode 各节点提供端口 "
+"8000–8003，代理监听 1999。此 PP2 布局与[第 5.1.2 节 A2 PD 标签页](#glm53-pd-a2)中的非缓存池 DP2 ×"
+" TP16 Prefill 布局不同。请使用第 4 节的 A2 镜像和 [A2 Decode 启动器](#glm53-pd-a2-launcher)。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The pooled Prefill and Decode engines both use `--max-model-len 128000`,\n"
+"    with MTP token counts 1 and 5, respectively.\n"
+"    The end-to-end limit is **128,000 tokens**, including input and output.\n"
+"    Both roles declare the actual Prefill DP1/PP2/TP8 partition `42,36` and\n"
+"    Decode DP16/TP2 topology."
+msgstr ""
+"缓存池的 Prefill 和 Decode 引擎均使用 `--max-model-len 128000`，MTP Token 数分别为 1 和 "
+"5。端到端长度上限为 **128,000 Token**，包含输入与输出。两端声明实际的 Prefill DP1/PP2/TP8、层划分 `42,36`"
+" 和 Decode DP16/TP2 拓扑。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Complete [MemCache backend setup](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)\n"
+"    on every node, including the hardware/CANN prerequisites and installation\n"
+"    of `memfabric-hybrid` and `memcache-hybrid`. Install `fastokens` on all\n"
+"    four Prefill nodes. All eight nodes must reach the same MetaService."
+msgstr ""
+"在每个节点完成 [MemCache "
+"后端配置](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-"
+"backend)，包括硬件/CANN 前置条件及 `memfabric-hybrid`、`memcache-hybrid` 安装。在全部 4 个 "
+"Prefill 节点安装 `fastokens`。全部 8 个节点必须能够访问同一个 MetaService。"
+
+msgid ""
+"On every Prefill and Decode **host**, configure hugepages before\n"
+"    starting MemCache services:"
+msgstr "在每个 Prefill 和 Decode **宿主机**上，先配置大页内存，再启动 MemCache 服务："
+
+msgid "The check must print:"
+msgstr "检查结果必须输出："
+
+msgid ""
+"This is a host prerequisite for the `device_rdma` configuration with\n"
+"    `40GB` DRAM per LocalService; check all eight hosts before proceeding."
+msgstr ""
+"这是采用 `device_rdma`、每个 LocalService 分配 `40GB` DRAM 的宿主机前置条件。继续操作前请检查全部 8 "
+"台宿主机。"
+
+msgid "Prepare `mmc-meta.conf` for the MetaService on `<MEMCACHE_META_IP>`:"
+msgstr "在 `<MEMCACHE_META_IP>` 上为 MetaService 准备 `mmc-meta.conf`："
+
+msgid ""
+"Prepare `mmc-local.conf` in shared storage, or an identical copy on every\n"
+"    node. Use the A2/RoCE protocol and allocate `40GB` of pooled DRAM per\n"
+"    LocalService:"
+msgstr ""
+"在共享存储上准备 `mmc-local.conf`，或在每节点放置相同副本。使用 A2/RoCE 协议，并为每个 LocalService 分配 "
+"`40GB` 缓存池 DRAM："
+
+msgid ""
+"`world_size=256` is the maximum number of LocalServices supported, with\n"
+"    headroom; it is not the number of NPUs in this deployment. `dram.size`\n"
+"    is allocated per LocalService: eight LocalServices contribute `320GB`\n"
+"    per fully populated A2 node. MetaService ports 5000/6000, metrics port\n"
+"    8009, Prefill master port 7060 on each instance leader, Decode DP RPC\n"
+"    port 12990, API/proxy ports, and the Mooncake ports derived from base\n"
+"    ports 30000/30200 must be reachable as appropriate."
+msgstr ""
+"`world_size=256` 是包含余量的 LocalService 数量上限，不是本部署的 NPU 数量。`dram.size` 按 "
+"LocalService 分配：完整配置的 A2 节点中，8 个 LocalService 合计提供 `320GB`。按各服务需要，确保 "
+"MetaService 端口 5000/6000、指标端口 8009、各 Prefill 实例主节点端口 7060、Decode DP RPC 端口 "
+"12990、API/代理端口，以及从基础端口 30000/30200 派生的 Mooncake 端口可达。"
+
+msgid ""
+"On **each** Prefill and Decode node, export the following settings using\n"
+"    that node's installed paths and interface:"
+msgstr "在**每个** Prefill 和 Decode 节点上，按本节点安装路径与网卡导出以下设置："
+
+msgid ""
+"The scripts use `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` to locate the same local\n"
+"    configuration. On the MetaService host, set `MEMCACHE_ROOT` to its\n"
+"    installation directory and place `mmc-meta.conf` under its `config`\n"
+"    directory, or set `MMC_META_CONFIG_PATH` to the actual file path."
+msgstr ""
+"脚本通过 `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 定位相同的本地配置。在 MetaService 主机上，将 `MEMCACHE_ROOT` "
+"设为安装目录，并将 `mmc-meta.conf` 放入其 `config` 目录；或通过 `MMC_META_CONFIG_PATH` "
+"指定实际文件路径。"
+
+msgid "###### Prefill Engine Script (Pooled)"
+msgstr "###### Prefill 引擎脚本（缓存池）"
+
+msgid ""
+"Save this script as `start_p_pool.sh` on P0-P3. The arguments select the\n"
+"    PP node rank, API port, local IP, instance leader IP, instance ID, and\n"
+"    visible devices. Both PP stages of one instance use the same master\n"
+"    address, partition, and engine ID. The two independent instances have\n"
+"    different master addresses and engine IDs."
+msgstr ""
+"在 P0–P3 将本脚本保存为 `start_p_pool.sh`。参数分别指定 PP 节点 rank、API 端口、本地 IP、实例主节点 IP、实例"
+" ID 和可见设备。同一实例的两个 PP 阶段使用相同主节点地址、层划分和引擎 ID；两个独立实例使用不同主节点地址及引擎 ID。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The Prefill script keeps `--no-async-scheduling` together with the V1\n"
+"    runner and `profiling_chunk_config.enabled=true`. Enabling async\n"
+"    scheduling with this combination is rejected by the runtime."
+msgstr ""
+"Prefill 脚本在使用 V1 运行器与 `profiling_chunk_config.enabled=true` 时保留 `--no-async-"
+"scheduling`。此组合下启用异步调度会被运行时拒绝。"
+
+msgid ""
+"PP headless workers may fail with\n"
+"    `Mooncake worker requires a local DP rank`. Each pooled Prefill instance\n"
+"    has DP size 1. Check whether the conditional fix in\n"
+"    [Local DP Rank Compatibility and Troubleshooting](#glm53-a2-rc1-compatibility)\n"
+"    applies to the installed worker on all Prefill nodes before starting\n"
+"    the two instances."
+msgstr ""
+"PP 无 API 工作进程可能报错 `Mooncake worker requires a local DP rank`。每个缓存池 Prefill "
+"实例的 DP 大小为 1。启动两个实例前，请在所有 Prefill 节点检查[本地 DP rank "
+"兼容性与故障排查](#glm53-a2-rc1-compatibility)中的条件修复是否适用于已安装的工作进程。"
+
+msgid "###### Decode Engine Script (Pooled)"
+msgstr "###### Decode 引擎脚本（缓存池）"
+
+msgid ""
+"Save this script as `start_d_engine_pool.sh` on D0-D3. Configure the\n"
+"    current node's `LOCAL_IP` in each copy and export the paths and NIC\n"
+"    settings from [Prepare MemCache](#glm53-pool-a2-prepare).\n"
+"    The A2 launcher supplies `$1`-`$7`."
+msgstr ""
+"在 D0–D3 将本脚本保存为 `start_d_engine_pool.sh`。每份脚本配置本节点的 `LOCAL_IP`，并导出[准备 "
+"MemCache](#glm53-pool-a2-prepare)中的路径和网卡设置。A2 启动器传入 `$1`–`$7`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Both scripts use `MultiConnector` with `MooncakeConnectorV2` for KV\n"
+"    transfer and `AscendStoreConnector` for non-layerwise MemCache pooling.\n"
+"    Distinct instance/rank-based engine IDs avoid P-to-D peer identity\n"
+"    conflicts. The outer ID is inherited by the child connectors.\n"
+"    `lookup_rpc_port=\"0\"` identifies an IPC endpoint that also includes the\n"
+"    DP rank; it is not a TCP listener on port zero."
+msgstr ""
+"两个脚本均通过 `MultiConnector` 组合 `MooncakeConnectorV2` 的 KV 传输和 "
+"`AscendStoreConnector` 的非逐层 MemCache 缓存池。基于实例和 rank 设置不同引擎 ID，以避免 P-to-D "
+"节点身份冲突；子连接器继承外层 ID。`lookup_rpc_port=\"0\"` 标识同时包含 DP rank 的 IPC 端点，并非在 TCP "
+"零端口监听。"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. Start the MetaService on `<MEMCACHE_META_IP>` before any vLLM process:"
+msgstr "1. 在任何 vLLM 进程启动前，先在 `<MEMCACHE_META_IP>` 上启动 MetaService："
+
+msgid ""
+"2. Export the settings from [Prepare MemCache](#glm53-pool-a2-prepare)\n"
+"       on **every** Prefill node. Start both PP stages of each instance in\n"
+"       separate terminals before waiting for the instance to become ready:"
+msgstr ""
+"2. 在**每个** Prefill 节点导出[准备 "
+"MemCache](#glm53-pool-a2-prepare)中的设置。在独立终端启动每个实例的两个 PP 阶段，然后再等待实例就绪："
+
+msgid ""
+"3. Export the settings from [Prepare MemCache](#glm53-pool-a2-prepare)\n"
+"       on every Decode node and start all four nodes before waiting for the\n"
+"       DP group to become ready:"
+msgstr ""
+"3. 在每个 Decode 节点导出[准备 MemCache](#glm53-pool-a2-prepare)中的设置。全部 4 个节点启动后，再等待 "
+"DP 组就绪："
+
+msgid ""
+"4. Confirm that the Decode worker logs report completion of the MemCache\n"
+"       DP initialization barrier before treating the group as ready:"
+msgstr "4. 将 DP 组视为就绪前，应确认 Decode 工作进程日志报告 MemCache DP 初始化屏障已完成："
+
+msgid ""
+"The Prefill instances have DP size 1 and do not enter this DP\n"
+"        barrier; check their logs for successful MemCache initialization and\n"
+"        verify that P1 and P3 joined their PP instances. They do not expose\n"
+"        HTTP APIs. On every node, confirm that the active `mmc-local.conf`\n"
+"        uses `device_rdma` and `dram.size = 40GB`."
+msgstr ""
+"Prefill 实例的 DP 大小为 1，不进入此 DP 屏障。应检查日志，确认 MemCache 初始化成功，且 P1、P3 已加入各自 PP "
+"实例；它们不提供 HTTP API。每个节点都应确认实际使用的 `mmc-local.conf` 设置为 `device_rdma` 和 "
+"`dram.size = 40GB`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Wait for the APIs on P0:8000, P2:8000, and all sixteen Decode APIs on\n"
+"        ports 8000-8003 to answer `GET /v1/models`. Use `curl --noproxy '*'`\n"
+"        for these checks when HTTP proxies are configured. Start the proxy\n"
+"        on P0 or another reachable host:"
+msgstr ""
+"等待 P0:8000、P2:8000 及全部 16 个 Decode API（端口 8000–8003）响应 `GET /v1/models`。若配置了"
+" HTTP 代理，检查时使用 `curl --noproxy '*'`。在 P0 或其他可达主机上启动代理："
+
+msgid "Select the tab that matches your deployment hardware."
+msgstr "请选择与部署硬件匹配的标签页。"
+
+msgid "##### Topology and Prerequisites"
+msgstr "##### 拓扑与前置条件"
+
+msgid ""
+"This is a separate FP8 reference from the A3 int8 1M example. Both roles use"
+" DP2/TP8 with MooncakeConnectorV2; Prefill enables KVPP and PCP1, while "
+"Decode explicitly sets DCP8. Do not add PP2 or copy A3 DCP settings into "
+"this scenario."
+msgstr ""
+"这是独立于 A3 int8 1M 示例的 FP8 参考配置。两端均使用 DP2/TP8 和 MooncakeConnectorV2；Prefill 启用"
+" KVPP、PCP1，Decode 显式设置 DCP8。不要在此场景增加 PP2，也不要复制 A3 的 DCP 设置。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The source sets Prefill to **1,046,576** tokens and Decode to **1,048,576**."
+" These values are preserved, not silently rounded. Until validated and "
+"reconciled, keep each request's total input plus requested output within "
+"**1,046,576** tokens, the smaller engine limit. Prefill has a 32,768-token "
+"batch budget and Decode 192 tokens."
+msgstr ""
+"来源配置将 Prefill 上限设置为 **1,046,576** Token，Decode 为 **1,048,576** "
+"Token。这里保留原值，不做隐式取整。在完成验证和统一前，每个请求的输入加期望输出总长度应不超过较小的引擎限制 **1,046,576** "
+"Token。Prefill 批处理预算为 32,768 Token，Decode 为 192 Token。"
+
+msgid "##### Prepare the Scripts"
+msgstr "##### 准备脚本"
+
+msgid "1. Prefill nodes 0 and 1"
+msgstr "1. Prefill 节点 0 和 1"
+
+msgid "2. Decode nodes 0 and 1"
+msgstr "2. Decode 节点 0 和 1"
+
+msgid "##### Start the Engines"
+msgstr "##### 启动引擎"
+
+msgid "##### Start the Proxy"
+msgstr "##### 启动代理"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `--data-parallel-size 2` and `--tensor-parallel-size 8` define both\n"
+"      roles. Each role spans two nodes, with one TP8 engine per node and\n"
+"      a separate DP group. Each node exposes API port `8000`.\n"
+"    - Prefill sets `enable_kvpp: true` in `--additional-config`;\n"
+"      Decode sets `--decode-context-parallel-size 8` to shard KV cache\n"
+"      across its TP group.\n"
+"    - `--max-model-len` is `1046576` on Prefill and `1048576` on Decode.\n"
+"      Prefill sets `--max-num-seqs 64` and\n"
+"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 32768`; Decode sets `32` and `192`,\n"
+"      respectively. Tune concurrency for the available KV cache capacity.\n"
+"    - MTP uses `deepseek_mtp` with an eager draft: one speculative token\n"
+"      on Prefill and five on Decode. Prefill uses `--enforce-eager`;\n"
+"      Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode.\n"
+"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` uses `kv_producer` on Prefill and `kv_consumer`\n"
+"      on Decode, with base KV ports `30000` and `30200`, respectively.\n"
+"      Both roles declare Prefill DP2/TP8 and Decode DP2/TP8.\n"
+"    - Both roles use FP8 attention and indexer KV caches and\n"
+"      `enable_fused_mc2: 1`. Prefill also enables DSA CP, FlashComm1 and\n"
+"      prefix caching."
+msgstr ""
+"- `--data-parallel-size 2` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size 8` 定义两个角色。每角色跨两个节点，每节点一个 TP8 引擎，各角色有独立 DP 组；每节点提供 API 端口 `8000`。\n"
+"    - Prefill 在 `--additional-config` 中设置 `enable_kvpp: true`；Decode 设置 `--decode-context-parallel-size 8`，在 TP 组中分片 KV 缓存。\n"
+"    - Prefill 的 `--max-model-len` 为 `1046576`，Decode 为 `1048576`。Prefill 设置 `--max-num-seqs 64`、`--max-num-batched-tokens 32768`，Decode 分别为 `32`、`192`。应按可用 KV 缓存容量调整并发。\n"
+"    - MTP 使用 `deepseek_mtp` 和 eager 草稿模型：Prefill 为 1 个推测 Token，Decode 为 5 个。Prefill 使用 `--enforce-eager`，Decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式。\n"
+"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` 在 Prefill 使用 `kv_producer`，Decode 使用 `kv_consumer`，基础 KV 端口分别为 `30000`、`30200`；两端均声明 Prefill DP2/TP8、Decode DP2/TP8。\n"
+"    - 两端均使用 FP8 注意力及索引器 KV 缓存和 `enable_fused_mc2: 1`。Prefill 还启用 DSA CP、FlashComm1 与前缀缓存。"
+
+msgid ""
+"This configuration uses GLM-5.3 W8A8C8 weights on four A3 series\n"
+"    nodes, with 16 logical NPU devices per node. Use the A3 image from\n"
+"    [Docker Image Installation](#4-installation) on all nodes.\n"
+"    The maximum context length is 1,048,576 tokens, including input and output."
+msgstr ""
+"本配置在 4 个 A3 系列节点上使用 GLM-5.3 W8A8C8 权重，每节点 16 个逻辑 NPU 设备。全部节点均使用 [Docker "
+"镜像安装](#4-installation)中的 A3 镜像。最大上下文长度为 1,048,576 Token，包含输入与输出。"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Role | Nodes | Global DP | TP | PP | DCP | Local DP ranks | Devices per role |\n"
+"    | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
+"    | Prefill | P0, P1 | 2 | 16 | 1 | 16 | One per node | 32 |\n"
+"    | Decode | D0, D1 | 4 | 8 | 1 | 8 | Two per node | 32 |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 角色 | 节点 | 全局 DP | TP | PP | DCP | 本地 DP rank 数 | 每个角色的设备数 |\n"
+"    | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
+"    | Prefill | P0, P1 | 2 | 16 | 1 | 16 | 每节点 1 个 | 32 |\n"
+"    | Decode | D0, D1 | 4 | 8 | 1 | 8 | 每节点 2 个 | 32 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"P0 and P1 run DP ranks 0 and 1. D0 runs ranks 0-1 and D1 runs ranks 2-3.\n"
+"    Prefill context parallel size is 1 on both roles. This DCP layout is\n"
+"    separate from the PP2 layout in Sections 5.1.3 and 5.1.4."
+msgstr ""
+"P0、P1 分别运行 DP rank 0、1；D0 运行 rank 0–1，D1 运行 rank 2–3。两端的 Prefill 上下文并行大小均为 "
+"1。此 DCP 布局与第 5.1.3、5.1.4 节的 PP2 布局不同。"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. Prepare identical weights on all four nodes and verify\n"
+"       [multi-node communication](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect).\n"
+"    2. Set `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, and `MODEL_PATH` separately on each node.\n"
+"       Replace the master address placeholders in the startup commands with\n"
+"       P0's IP for Prefill and D0's IP for Decode.\n"
+"    3. Reserve DP RPC ports 16591 and 16600, API port 8000 on each Prefill\n"
+"       node, API ports 8000-8001 on each Decode node, and Mooncake transfer\n"
+"       ports derived from the configured base ports 30000 and 30200.\n"
+"       Run the public proxy on a separate host at port 8000."
+msgstr ""
+"1. 在全部 4 个节点准备相同权重，并验证[多节点通信](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect)。\n"
+"    2. 在各节点分别配置 `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME`、`MODEL_PATH`。启动命令中的主节点地址，Prefill 使用 P0 的 IP，Decode 使用 D0 的 IP。\n"
+"    3. 预留 DP RPC 端口 16591、16600，各 Prefill 节点的 API 端口 8000，各 Decode 节点的 API 端口 8000–8001，以及从基础端口 30000、30200 派生的 Mooncake 传输端口。在独立主机的 8000 端口运行对外代理。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Run these commands from the directory containing both scripts on each node.\n"
+"    The two Prefill commands use the same P0 master address, and the two Decode\n"
+"    commands use the same D0 master address."
+msgstr ""
+"在各节点包含两个脚本的目录中执行以下命令。两条 Prefill 命令使用同一个 P0 主节点地址，两条 Decode 命令使用同一个 D0 主节点地址。"
+
+msgid ""
+"After all six APIs become healthy, start the proxy on its separate host:"
+msgstr "全部 6 个 API 就绪后，在独立主机上启动代理："
+
+msgid "Send requests to `<PROXY_IP>:8000` using the served model name `glm`."
+msgstr "使用模型服务名 `glm` 向 `<PROXY_IP>:8000` 发送请求。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- The launcher passes `$1` = visible devices, `$2` = API port, `$3` = global\n"
+"      DP size, `$4` = DP rank, `$5` = DP master IP, `$6` = DP RPC port, and\n"
+"      `$7` = TP size to `run_dp_template.sh`.\n"
+"    - `--decode-context-parallel-size`: 16 on Prefill and 8 on Decode;\n"
+"      `--prefill-context-parallel-size` remains 1 and\n"
+"      `--cp-kv-cache-interleave-size` is 128 on both roles.\n"
+"    - `--max-num-batched-tokens`: 8192 on Prefill and 192 on Decode.\n"
+"      `--max-num-seqs`: 64 on Prefill and 32 on Decode. These are scheduler\n"
+"      limits; start the 1M workload with one concurrent request and increase\n"
+"      concurrency according to available KV cache capacity.\n"
+"    - MTP uses `deepseek_mtp` with an eager draft: 1 speculative token on\n"
+"      Prefill and 5 on Decode. Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode.\n"
+"    - `MooncakeConnectorV1` uses `kv_producer` on Prefill and `kv_consumer`\n"
+"      on Decode, with the same `prefill: DP2/TP16` and `decode: DP4/TP8`\n"
+"      topology on both roles. This example does not enable MemCache pooling.\n"
+"    - Both roles use int8 KV and indexer KV caches. Prefill enables DSA CP,\n"
+"      fused MC2 and FlashComm1; Decode enables fused MC2, MLAPO and the\n"
+"      recomputation scheduler. See [Performance Tuning](#9-performance-tuning).\n"
+"    - `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc`: Enables 4-bit TurboQuant\n"
+"      quantization for the SFA packed main KV cache, as an alternative to\n"
+"      `--kv-cache-dtype int8`. It requires an A2/A3 device, does not support\n"
+"      context parallelism (DCP/PCP), and cannot be combined with the C8 cache.\n"
+"      It is therefore not supported by the DCP-enabled 1M example above.\n"
+"      In Prefill-Decode disaggregation the\n"
+"      Mooncake option `\"use_ascend_direct\"` must be `false`."
+msgstr ""
+"- 启动器向 `run_dp_template.sh` 传入 `$1` = 可见设备、`$2` = API 端口、`$3` = 全局 DP 大小、`$4` = DP rank、`$5` = DP 主节点 IP、`$6` = DP RPC 端口、`$7` = TP 大小。\n"
+"    - `--decode-context-parallel-size`：Prefill 为 16，Decode 为 8；两端 `--prefill-context-parallel-size` 保持 1，`--cp-kv-cache-interleave-size` 均为 128。\n"
+"    - `--max-num-batched-tokens`：Prefill 为 8192，Decode 为 192；`--max-num-seqs` 分别为 64、32。这些是调度限制；1M 负载应从单请求并发开始，按可用 KV 缓存容量增加并发。\n"
+"    - MTP 使用 `deepseek_mtp` 和 eager 草稿模型：Prefill 为 1 个推测 Token，Decode 为 5 个；Decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式。\n"
+"    - `MooncakeConnectorV1` 在 Prefill 使用 `kv_producer`，Decode 使用 `kv_consumer`，两端使用相同的 `prefill: DP2/TP16`、`decode: DP4/TP8` 拓扑。本例不启用 MemCache 缓存池。\n"
+"    - 两端均使用 int8 注意力及索引器 KV 缓存。Prefill 启用 DSA CP、融合 MC2 和 FlashComm1；Decode 启用融合 MC2、MLAPO 和重计算调度器。参阅[性能调优](#9-performance-tuning)。\n"
+"    - `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc` 为 SFA 打包主 KV 缓存启用 4 位 TurboQuant 量化，替代 `--kv-cache-dtype int8`。该选项要求 A2/A3 设备，不支持上下文并行（DCP/PCP），且不能与 C8 缓存同时使用，因此不适用于上方启用 DCP 的 1M 示例。在 Prefill-Decode 分离场景中，Mooncake 的 `\"use_ascend_direct\"` 必须设为 `false`。"
