+msgid ""
+"GLM-5.3-Flash model currently supports only model runner V1 on Ascend, so\n"
+"all A3 series scripts set `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` explicitly."
+msgstr ""
+"GLM-5.3-Flash 目前在昇腾上仅支持 V1 模型运行器，因此所有 A3 系列脚本均显式设置 "
+"`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Download the checkpoint from ModelScope for the hardware shown below. A3 and"
+" 950DT products checkpoints use different quantization formats; do not "
+"interchange them. The scripts use `/root/.cache/modelscope/hub/models/vllm-"
+"ascend/<checkpoint-name>` as a local mount path, not as a download source. "
+"Preserve the exact case of the repository name when naming the local "
+"directory."
+msgstr ""
+"请根据下表中的硬件从 ModelScope 下载权重。A3 与 950DT products 使用不同量化格式，不能混用。脚本中的 "
+"`/root/.cache/modelscope/hub/models/vllm-ascend/<checkpoint-name>` "
+"是本地挂载路径，不是下载来源。命名本地目录时请保留仓库名称的大小写。"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Checkpoint | Hardware | Deployment | Download | Notes |\n"
+"| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
+"| `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8` | 950DT products (96GB × 8 per node) | 1 node for single-node deployment; 2 nodes for 1P1D PD | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8) | Supports a W8A8C8 configuration: C8 is dynamic KV-cache quantization. Set `--kv-cache-dtype fp8` in the serving command to enable FP8 KV cache; no separate C8 checkpoint is required. |\n"
+"| `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8` | A3 series (128GB × 8 per node) | 1 node for single-node deployment; 2 nodes for 1P1D PD | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8) | Supports a W8A8C8 configuration: C8 is dynamic KV-cache quantization. Set `--kv-cache-dtype int8` in the serving command to enable INT8 KV cache; no separate C8 checkpoint is required. |\n"
+"| `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8` | A2 series (64GB × 8 per node) | 2 nodes for colocated deployment; 4 nodes for PD | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8) | / |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 权重 | 硬件 | 部署 | 下载 | 说明 |\n"
+"| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
+"| `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8` | 950DT products（每节点 96GB × 8） | 单节点部署使用 1 节点；1P1D PD 使用 2 节点 | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8) | 支持 W8A8C8 配置：C8 表示动态 KV 缓存量化。在服务命令中设置 `--kv-cache-dtype fp8` 启用 FP8 KV 缓存，无需单独的 C8 权重。 |\n"
+"| `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8` | A3 系列（每节点 128GB × 8） | 单节点部署使用 1 节点；1P1D PD 使用 2 节点 | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8) | 支持 W8A8C8 配置：C8 表示动态 KV 缓存量化。在服务命令中设置 `--kv-cache-dtype int8` 启用 INT8 KV 缓存，无需单独的 C8 权重。 |\n"
+"| `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8` | A2 系列（每节点 64GB × 8） | 同机部署使用 2 节点；PD 使用 4 节点 | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8) | / |"
+
+msgid ""
+"You can use the official all-in-one Docker image. For the available image "
